# The frozen corpus is byte-exact research data, not source code.
#
# Every document record and the manifest are linked to experiment artifacts by
# SHA-256 (content_sha256, raw_sha256, and the run's dataset/source hashes).  Git's
# end-of-line normalisation would rewrite those bytes on checkout and silently break
# every recorded hash, so normalisation is disabled for everything under this tree.
* -text
